          String: Swirl
        Tooltip:
          String: "How much the glitter twists around the toy as it rises, like stirred water. Turns of rotation from the bottom to the top of the cluster (turns, 0.15 = about 54 degrees). 0 = no swirl. Keep it small."
      PositionX: -900
